@startuml
actor Manager
participant "estate-service" as Estate
database "estate DB" as EstateDB
participant "estate outbox relay (M1A)" as Relay
queue "RabbitMQ" as Bus
participant "spatial consumer (M1B/M1C)" as Spatial
database "spatial DB" as SpatialDB
Manager -> Estate : authorized identity command (M1A)
Estate -> EstateDB : begin: domain mutation + outbox event
EstateDB --> Estate : commit
Estate --> Manager : accepted canonical ID
Relay -> EstateDB : lock unpublished batch
Relay -> Bus : persistent event with stable eventId
Bus --> Relay : publisher confirm
Relay -> EstateDB : mark published after confirmation
Bus -> Spatial : at-least-once delivery
Spatial -> SpatialDB : begin; INSERT processed_event ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
alt inserted
  Spatial -> SpatialDB : update service-owned identity projection
else duplicate
  Spatial -> SpatialDB : no duplicate effect
end
Spatial -> SpatialDB : commit marker and effect together
Spatial --> Bus : ACK after commit; retry/DLQ on error
note over Relay,Spatial : M1C verifies the real Estate v2 relay and Spatial projection together; duplicate deliveries are expected.
@enduml
